# Derived at build time by scripts/build-docs.sh:
#   openapi.json  — generated by `suede openapi`
#   scalar.js     — vendored Scalar bundle
# Derived by scripts/artwork_hook.py during MkDocs builds:
#   artwork/      — icons, header images, and social cards
# Copied from fonts/ by scripts/fonts_hook.py during MkDocs builds:
#   fonts/        — local WOFF2 fonts, stylesheet, and licenses
*
!.gitignore
